Bind Npc 14203 Zone 2 for mage
Quest 324 "Nostrum of Magic"
    Journal "A Nostrum of Magic is required for learning 70Lv and 80Lv skills, and [Archmage] Drake will make it for you if you bring him 2 Feathers of Harpy Queen, 5 Venomous Tails of Lesath, and 2 packs of Magic Powder, which are the ingredients of Nostrum of Magic."
    Collect 1 of 379046000
    Collect 1 of 379041000
    Collect 2 of 379236000

Requires player level >= 69 and player is elmorad

Rewards
    Give 1 of 379247000

On offer
    Say "I see that you will soon reach the level of Archmage and be my equal.  When you reach that final stage of magicians, you get to learn the ultimate magic.  There is no being that can easily take on a magician who has learned the ultimate magic. Not even a god... \nYou can never complete that ultimate magic with some ordinary skills.  To complete the ultimate magic, you would need the Nostrum of Magic and a Stamp of Magic Power.  Moreover, those two items also require combining several different substances to make them."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "To start off, Nostrum of Magic requires 2 Feathers of Harpy Queen, 5 Venomous Tails of Lesath, and 2 Magic Powders to make.  So, do you feel like bringing them here?\n\nYou are able to master Ultimate Magic when you reach the highest mage level(70Lv). Magic Nostrum and the Stamp of Magic Power is required to complete Ultimate Magic. [Archmage] Drake awards the Magic Nostrum for 2 Feather of Harpy Queen, 5 Tail of Lesth and 2 Magic Jewel Power."

On in_progress
    Say "To make the Nostrum of Magic, you need 2 Feathers of Harpy Queen, 5 Venomous Tails of Lesath, and 2 Magic Powders.  You must not miss even one."

On ready
    Say "Master. You have collected all the materials for needed for the Nostrum of Magic.  I really wonder what this ultimate magic could be."
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "The ingredients are sufficient. This is the Magic Nostrum. Hyahh...\nHere, the Magic Nostrum is an important object, but it's useless in any task other than completing  Ultimate Magic."
